          "semanticId": "PTX-ADD-SEM2-049",
          "classification": "DESIGN_DEPENDENCY",
          "statement": "Minimal machine state design (architecture D-5, D-14): the state for base add.u32 is the pair (value-register file, predicate-register file); no memory, shared, special-register, or concurrency state is required by the add.u32 syntax and description.",
