            "heading": "Integer Arithmetic Instructions: add",
            "anchor": "integer-arithmetic-instructions-add",
            "startLine": 8763,
            "endLine": 8774
          },
          "quotation": "add.type1        d, a, b;\nadd{.sat}.type2  d, a, b;\n\n.type1 = { .u16, .u64,\n           .s16, .s64 };\n\n.type2 = { .u32, .u16x2, .u8x4,\n           .s32, .s16x2, .s8x4 };"
        },
        {
