            "heading": "Integer Arithmetic Instructions: add",
            "anchor": "integer-arithmetic-instructions-add",
            "startLine": 8775,
            "endLine": 8776
          },
          "quotation": "Performs addition and writes the resulting value into a destination register."
        },
